From aaedf1bcbffde405f9e638e4de45744c3c746b96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nebula Flatpak <noreply@example.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:10:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add Flatpak support to Discover and Installed

Flatpak apps are searched, listed, installed and removed alongside XBPS
packages. They are stored internally as flatpak:<app-id> and routed to the
flatpak CLI; the UI shows their friendly name and a Flatpak tag, and hides
Hold for them. Support turns itself off when flatpak is not installed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
